# Design 81 R4: Loams runs RisingWave without a licence key, so a paid-tier
# feature check must fail on every managed instance. v3.1.0's own test of this
# is e2e_test/error_ui/simple/license.slt (rw_test_feature('TestDummy')).
#
# First run (2026-10-28, v3.1.0 playground): `license_key` reads `<default>`,
# a built-in key, and the check failed only because the host had 14 CPU cores
# and that key allows 4. On a cluster of 4 cores or fewer the built-in key
# would enable paid features, so the managed profile must clear it (RW-a;
# reported to ENG81). The regex accepts both refusals ("not available based
# on your license", "not available due to license error").
statement error not available
SELECT rw_test_feature('TestDummy');
